@* The visitor's colour theme: a three-position rocker, sun (Light) | Auto (System) | moon (Dark), wired by wwwroot/theme.js (docs/theme.md).
   Presentational only: the script does the work, so without it the rocker shows but changes nothing. Styling comes from the app's own CSS tokens
   (the snippet in docs/theme.md). The icons are inline SVG so the control needs no image files and takes the current text colour. *@
<div class="wc-theme" role="group" aria-label="Colour theme">
    <button type="button" class="wc-theme-button" data-theme-choice="light" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Light theme" title="Light theme">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" />
            <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4" />
        </svg>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="wc-theme-button wc-theme-auto" data-theme-choice="system" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Match system" title="Match system">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" />
            <path d="M12 4a8 8 0 0 1 0 16Z" fill="currentColor" />
        </svg>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="wc-theme-button" data-theme-choice="dark" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Dark theme" title="Dark theme">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M20 14.5A8 8 0 0 1 9.5 4 8 8 0 1 0 20 14.5Z" />
        </svg>
    </button>
</div>
